@startuml C4-Dynamic-Explore-Ai-Bff
!include style-zinc.puml

title 动态图 — Explore AI BFF（Published Language）

actor "终端用户" as User <<ui>>
participant "Explore Chat Web" as Web <<ui>>
participant "ExploreAiController\n(Nest BFF)" as Bff <<java>>
participant "ExploreAiClientService\n(ACL)" as Client <<java>>
participant "@explore/contracts-ai\nOpenAPI" as Contract <<external>>
participant "Explore AI\n/api/text|sessions" as Ai <<java>>

User -> Web : 触发 AI 能力
Web -> Bff : HTTPS /api/v1/ai/explore/*
note right of Bff
  客户端不携带上游
  X-Service-Key
end note

Bff -> Client : listProviders / streamChat / sessions
Client -> Contract : 路径与头对齐 Published Language
Client -> Ai : GET/POST + X-Service-Key\nX-Client-Id X-Request-Id
Ai --> Client : JSON / SSE
Client --> Bff : 防腐后的响应
Bff --> Web : WhatsFeed API 形状
Web --> User : UI

@enduml
